<title>NEW ZEALAND: Power NZ gives reaction to Mercury/UNZ plan.</title>
<headline>Power NZ gives reaction to Mercury/UNZ plan.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Power New Zealand Limited said on Wednesday it planned to take no action on a plan by major shareholders Mercury Energy and U.S-owned Utilicorp New Zealand to take joint control of the company.</p>
<p>In a statement of immediate formal response, made under stock exchange rules, Power NZ said its directors &quot;do not propose to take any further action, conduct any investigation, or make any report or disclosure in response to the relevant proposals at this time&quot;.</p>
</text>
